    given-names: Rudra
    affiliation: "Adani University, Department of Computer Science and Engineering (AI-ML)"
  - family-names: Navadiya
    given-names: Pruthvi
    affiliation: "Adani University, Department of Computer Science and Engineering (AI-ML)"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - "traffic signal coordination"
  - "constraint satisfaction problem"
  - "backtracking search"
  - "forward checking"
  - "branch and bound"
message: >-
  Please cite this project in academic reports. This software is an educational
  simulation and decision-support prototype; it is not a certified traffic-control
  system and its synthetic results must not be presented as field measurements.
type: software
